            <div xml:id="d903">

                <pb facs="1076" n="1066" sameAs="frus:frus1943v01/pg1066"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.515/604a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-04-14T00:00:00-04:00">April 14,
                            1943—midnight</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2378. To Casaday from White. Secretary Morgenthau is arranging schedule for
                    discussions with technical experts of preliminary draft outline of proposal for
                    international stabilization fund. Secretary would like you to inquire of finance
                    ministers of exiled governments except French National Committee when their
                    experts may be expected for discussions and whom they expect to send.
                    [White.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
